    <string name="settings_feedback_footer">Buzz on right and wrong answers. Voice answers let you speak instead of tap (uses the microphone).</string>
    <string name="settings_feedback_footer_haptics_only">Buzz on right and wrong answers.</string>
    <string name="settings_hardware_key">Hardware key</string>
    <string name="settings_hardware_key_footer">How the adapter should read your key. Straight key is the default; pick an iambic mode for a paddle. This is your key, not a drill setting — it applies in Sending Practice and on the Vail screen alike.</string>
